":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l022","ordinal":306156,"en":"But here the medicine did no good,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l023","ordinal":306157,"en":"And Choro did not recover."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l024","ordinal":306158,"en":"Grieving in all sincerity,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l025","ordinal":306159,"en":"Despairing of his fly-like life,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l026","ordinal":306160,"en":"Choro burned with humiliation,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l027","ordinal":306161,"en":"And despaired of his entrusted life."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l028","ordinal":306162,"en":"As Choro stood there thus,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l029","ordinal":306163,"en":"Your foster-father Kyzylsart"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l030","ordinal":306164,"en":"Was himself the healer,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l031","ordinal":306165,"en":"A keen and careful eye,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l032","ordinal":306166,"en":"Weighing thoughts and shaping words,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l033","ordinal":306167,"en":"He also had discernment,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l034","ordinal":306168,"en":"A remedy for every illness,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l035","ordinal":306169,"en":"And he also had resourcefulness."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l036","ordinal":306170,"en":"When the sun sank shimmering,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l037","ordinal":306171,"en":"When the foremost of the people lay down,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l038","ordinal":306172,"en":"A blue mastiff with a leather-capped head,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l039","ordinal":306173,"en":"A dog left behind by the gray wolf,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b002:l040","ordinal":306174,"en":"Howled and whimpered in grief."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b003:l001","ordinal":306175,"en":"Parted from the magnanimous lion,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0145:b003:l002","ordinal":306176,"en":"We stand here powerless."}]
